### Doctor Schedule Management API Tester
### Base: http://localhost:5000
### Auth: Bearer <doctorToken> required for all /api/doctors/schedules
### Timezone: Asia/Dhaka, window 00:01-03:00 for following day

### 1. Get schedule window status (any time, shows isOpen)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules/window
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. List my schedules (own only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 3. Create schedule - SUCCESS only if 00:01-03:00 and date is tomorrow (backend auto-targets tomorrow)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "10:00",
  "end_time": "11:00"
}

### 3b. Create with explicit tomorrow date (must equal tomorrow)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available_date": "2026-09-05",
  "start_time": "10:00",
  "end_time": "11:00"
}

### 4. Create overlapping - should 409
POST http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "10:30",
  "end_time": "11:30"
}

### 5. Create with invalid time - should 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "12:00",
  "end_time": "11:00"
}

### 6. Create outside window - should 403 (test at 03:01 or 11:00 PM)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "14:00",
  "end_time": "15:00"
}

### 7. Create for wrong date - should 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available_date": "2026-09-10",
  "start_time": "10:00",
  "end_time": "11:00"
}

### 8. Update own schedule - SUCCESS only within window and tomorrow
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "09:00",
  "end_time": "10:00"
}

### 9. Update to overlapping - should 409
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "10:15",
  "end_time": "11:15"
}

### 10. Toggle availability - allowed only in window, own slot, tomorrow
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules/1/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slot_status": "unavailable"
}

### 11. Toggle back
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules/1/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slot_status": "available"
}

### 12. Delete own tomorrow slot - allowed only in window
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 13. Try to modify another doctor's slot - should 403
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules/999
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "10:00",
  "end_time": "11:00"
}

### 14. Staff trying doctor schedule - should 403 (role)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/doctors/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "10:00",
  "end_time": "11:00"
}

### 15. Staff view available slots (read-only, staff role)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/staff/available-schedules?doctor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 16. Staff assign slot to appointment (staff cannot create slot)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/staff/appointments/1/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "schedule_id": 1
}

### 17. Staff assign expired slot - should 400
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/staff/appointments/1/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "schedule_id": 999
}

### 18. Patient view doctor available schedules
GET http://localhost:5000/api/patients/doctors/1/schedules

### 19. Patient payment with expired slot - should 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/patients/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": 1,
  "appointment_id": 1,
  "payment_method": "cash"
}
